 "text": "The answers follow from standard facts. Question cb020ef5 is missing its number sequence, so that answer is a guess.\n\n1. Lord William Bentinck abolished sati in 1829.\n2. The Bengali script comes from the Brahmi script.\n3. The olfactory nerve carries smell signals to the brain.\n4. The lead storage cell is Pb, PbSO₄/H₂SO₄/PbO₂, Pb.\n5. The Hijri calendar counts from 622 AD, the year of the Hijrat.\n6. The axial skeleton has 80 bones.\n7. Justice Abdus Sattar was Chief Election Commissioner in 1970.\n8. Chrysocolla is CuSiO₃·2H₂O.\n9. শব means a dead body, not \"strong\", so B is the mismatched pair.\n10. I chose 49, since 7, 49, 343 are successive powers of 7.\n11. The Krebs cycle takes place in the mitochondria.\n12. Sierra Leone gave Bengali the status of an honorary official language.\n13. For a plano-concave lens, |f| = R/(n−1) = 60/0.6 = 100 cm. The sign is negative because the lens diverges.\n14. The domain requires 49 − x² ≥ 0, so the domain is [−7, 7].\n15. \"অক্ষির সমীপে\" shortens to প্রত্যক্ষ.\n\n{\"answers\": {\"c4490735-fcf6-4470-9612-b340d898523a-73076\": \"D\", \"c4fff258-98e8-4a51-adfd-41dc285290b0-73931\": \"C\", \"c66ad5ed-0066-4668-8826-a2b4f5a4dcac-85508\": \"A\", \"c6977869-bdc1-45b2-8b7d-e1f439bd4059-48825\": \"B\", \"c7a360bb-53a7-40fd-a265-c6d039e95c89-127617\": \"B\", \"c80dafc0-b0a5-4059-9b5a-ffa50f747302-19959\": \"B\", \"c82168c2-940c-4f0d-9bd2-d622b2ad3308-13643\": \"C\", \"ca6458d7-bb88-4f70-b2be-00904d41ac19-116217\": \"A\", \"cad30017-bd5f-4431-a070-0dae70ee02b3-65981\": \"B\", \"cb020ef5-9e86-4db6-aedd-29fe4051cf7e-117680\": \"D\", \"cba752a1-878f-4829-9c26-076a80413eea-4910\": \"C\", \"cc4593ae-e552-47c1-b36f-d6ec9ba37e6a-30477\": \"D\", \"ce3106e5-4aab-4829-be32-af5107481c53-124527\": \"B\", \"cff69f66-a30d-49c4-8854-3f3d4e538b69-123786\": \"C\", \"d044497d-1fa2-47eb-b0dd-e8735a7a36e8-8175\": \"C\"}}",
